    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1754880029\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1754880029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1754880029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1754880029\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/edc0034ada71415b6f8dde0f805d4c96.webp?t=1754880029\" width=200 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist visits a certain personal gym upon the recommendation of a close friend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After presenting a mysterious card, they are immediately enrolled in a special training course. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the contract, they engage in erotic muscle training every night at midnight, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but due to a decrease in stamina, completing the full course proves to be challenging....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with a beautiful trainer, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the protagonist strives to complete the full course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/d0f3540d916f63b408752daa296a6c48.webp?t=1754880029\" width=200 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A daily late-night erotic muscle training simulation game with a beautiful personal trainer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete all courses, players gather calories burned during workouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulated calories are used to enhance physical abilities, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nurturing a healthy body and achieving goals by repeating workouts every night at midnight....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/045f133aa8dba6c553204221670232d8.webp?t=1754880029\" width=200 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/1da12790d031e0ef02d448fc071ead2d.poster.avif?t=1754880029\" width=616 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/1da12790d031e0ef02d448fc071ead2d.webm?t=1754880029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/1da12790d031e0ef02d448fc071ead2d.mp4?t=1754880029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stretch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense base, consumes large amounts of stamina, increases pleasure given.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loosens the base, conserves stamina.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endurance</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recovers stamina and vigor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strong Strike</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increases technique within a few turns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduces consumption of vigor within a few turns. (Function not available in trial version)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Focus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skips opponent's special actions within a few turns. (Function not available in trial version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846210/extras/2265ca9353e9a03b5ca49340341cc1c7.webp?t=1754880029\" width=200 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Situations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Intercrural sex,&quot; &quot;Cowgirl position,&quot; &quot;Doggy style&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three H-scenes in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All H-scenes are AE animations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
